{"product_id":"great-american-short-stories-barnes-noble-signature-editions","title":"Angel","description":"\u003cp\u003eAngels are all around us: beautiful, awe-inspiring, irresistible.Ordinary mortals yearn to catch a glimpse of one of these stunning beings and thousands flock to The Church of Angels to feel their healing touch.But what if their potent magnetism isn't what it seems?Willow knows she's different from other girls. And not just because she loves tinkering around with cars.Willow has a gift. She can look into people's futures, know their dreams, their hopes and their regrets, just by touching them. But she has no idea where she gets this power from.Until she meets Alex‰Û?Alex is one of the few who know the truth about angels. He knows Willow's secret and is on a mission to stop her.The dark forces within Willow make her dangerous ‰ÛÒ and irresistible.In spite of himself, Alex finds he is falling in love with his sworn enemy.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: La Weatherly | Lee Weatherly\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781409521969\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 506\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45208696160409,"sku":"17RE-2-9781409521969","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67cfbab23bfaa_Great_20American_20Short_20Stories_20_Barnes_20_20Noble_20Signature_20Editions_20La_20Weatherly_20__20Lee_20Weatherly.jpg?v=1741798295","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/great-american-short-stories-barnes-noble-signature-editions","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}